sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Python Code<br/>(Jupyter / App)
    participant Model as trustyai.Model<br/>PredictionProviderArrow
    participant JPype as JPype1 JVM Bridge<br/>JNI
    participant JAR as TrustyAI Java Library<br/>explainability-arrow JAR
    participant Arrow as Apache Arrow IPC<br/>Zero-copy Transfer

    Note over User,Arrow: Flow 1: Local Model Explainability (In-Process)

    User->>Model: model = Model(sklearn_model)
    User->>Model: explainer.explain(model, data)
    Model->>JPype: Initialize JVM (lazy, first use)
    JPype->>JAR: Start embedded JVM

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Model,JAR: LIME/SHAP Explanation Loop (1000s of iterations)
        Model->>Arrow: Serialize DataFrame to Arrow IPC bytes
        Arrow->>JAR: Zero-copy PredictionInput transfer
        JAR->>JPype: Callback: predict(perturbed_input)
        JPype->>Model: Python predict function invocation
        Model-->>JPype: Prediction results (numpy array)
        JPype-->>JAR: PredictionOutput (via Arrow IPC)
        JAR-->>JPype: Saliency / explanation results
    end

    JPype-->>Model: LimeResults / SHAPResults
    Model-->>User: Explanation object with .plot() method

    participant MetricsSvc as TrustyAIMetricsService<br/>Client
    participant OSRoute as OpenShift Route API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Thanos as Thanos Querier<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    Note over User,Thanos: Flow 2: Remote Metrics (Optional, via [api] extra)

    User->>MetricsSvc: TrustyAIMetricsService(token, namespace)
    MetricsSvc->>OSRoute: GET /routes (discover TrustyAI endpoint)<br/>Auth: kubeconfig / in-cluster
    OSRoute-->>MetricsSvc: Route URL for TrustyAI Service

    User->>MetricsSvc: upload_data(dataframe)
    MetricsSvc->>TrustyAI: POST /data/upload<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>TLS encrypted
    TrustyAI-->>MetricsSvc: 200 OK

    User->>MetricsSvc: get_model_info()
    MetricsSvc->>TrustyAI: GET /info<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    TrustyAI-->>MetricsSvc: Model metadata JSON

    User->>MetricsSvc: schedule_metric("SPD", params)
    MetricsSvc->>TrustyAI: POST /metrics/spd/request<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    TrustyAI-->>MetricsSvc: Metric schedule confirmation

    User->>MetricsSvc: query_metric("trustyai_spd")
    MetricsSvc->>Thanos: GET /api/v1/query?query=trustyai_spd<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Thanos-->>MetricsSvc: PromQL time-series results
    MetricsSvc-->>User: Metric DataFrame
